{"schema_version": 2, "model": "google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "effort": "medium", "params": {"n": 96, "q": 16847121}, "seed": 1262498226, "solved": "solved", "parsed": true, "verify_ok": true, "verify_reason": "ok", "reply": "To find the exact rational normalized cut coordinates, we determine each agent's contribution based on the sign of the intervals they value. \n\nFor the general slot structure, every agent $i$ has a base density $C=1$ distributed on the central part of every slot. Depending on the parity of the cut indices $j$, this uniform density creates a value difference between the $+$ and $-$ labels precisely equal to $z_j$ for each slot $j$. The extra density $C$ on the special slot $s$ contributes an additional $z_s$. \nThe remaining non-zero densities $L=195$ and $R$ lie on the guard slot $g$. They are either entirely in the $+$ portion or entirely in the $-$ portion, again dictated by the parity of $g$. This gives the strict relation:\n$$ \\sum_{j=0}^{95} z_j + z_s + (-1)^g (L - R) = 0 $$\nLet $S = \\sum_{j=0}^{95} z_j$ be the sum of all cut coordinates. We can write $V_s = (-1)^{g+1}(L - R) = (-1)^g (R - 195)$ and so we must have:\n$$ z_s = V_s - S $$\n\nWe compute $V_s$ for every agent $0 \\dots 95$ precisely. Because the denominator for all cuts is specified as $D = 16847121$, we find the numerators of $V_s$ by evaluating $(R \\times D - 195 \\times 16847121)$. (If $R$ is given over a denominator of $5615707$, we multiply its numerator by $3$).\nSumming these $V_s$ values over all 96 special slots $s$ allows us to resolve $S$:\n$$ \\sum_{s=0}^{95} V_s = 97 S $$\nCarrying out the sum exactly yields $\\sum_{s=0}^{95} V_s = -634256616 / 16847121$.\nDividing by 97 gives exactly $S = -6538728 / 16847121$.\n\nUsing $z_s = V_s - S = \\frac{V_s \\cdot 16847121 + 6538728}{16847121}$, we compute the numerator for each $z_s$ in order from $z_0$ to $z_{95}$.\n\n<answer>-7985194/16847121, -11431959/16847121, -13262493/16847121, -16185595/16847121, 10972059/16847121, 5965815/16847121, -1485366/16847121, -2626639/16847121, 14638099/16847121, 13045287/16847121, -8943369/16847121, 16574579/16847121, -12283084/16847121, -6659561/16847121, -3318027/16847121, -13307302/16847121, 11295661/16847121, 9694938/16847121, -1924435/16847121, 1641603/16847121, -1645806/16847121, 8879069/16847121, 9103316/16847121, -6063541/16847121, -9272146/16847121, 12775796/16847121, -1998491/16847121, -3579848/16847121, 12619054/16847121, 11050800/16847121, 3496100/16847121, -10291161/16847121, 15860331/16847121, -14171917/16847121, 13101463/16847121, -6810161/16847121, 8513520/16847121, -12762175/16847121, -9564552/16847121, 920968/16847121, 9458561/16847121, -8324200/16847121, 3602533/16847121, -12417549/16847121, -12337439/16847121, 1581798/16847121, 13460052/16847121, -11955468/16847121, 4396233/16847121, 11580979/16847121, 8270856/16847121, 16732925/16847121, 138405/16847121, -12223249/16847121, -628049/16847121, -6952803/16847121, 16001240/16847121, -14001660/16847121, -948305/16847121, 6152420/16847121, 4789379/16847121, -4454426/16847121, 6252235/16847121, -676618/16847121, 4724185/16847121, 3613643/16847121, 5965841/16847121, 2308312/16847121, -2401931/16847121, 6425755/16847121, -2992943/16847121, 5869588/16847121, -14721097/16847121, -16184427/16847121, 3072748/16847121, -6775699/16847121, 6953709/16847121, 15498548/16847121, 7597296/16847121, -4014748/16847121, -12182350/16847121, 3202746/16847121, -16219890/16847121, -1895077/16847121, 1210603/16847121, 13316040/16847121, -4282928/16847121, -145672/16847121, -696947/16847121, 7248889/16847121, -291795/16847121, -5593177/16847121, -603487/16847121, -11550026/16847121, -12525044/16847121, -2542879/16847121</answer>", "error": null, "elapsed_sec": 175.77, "http_status": 200, "finish_reason": "stop", "preset": "escalated", "escalation_round": 6}
